{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2023-03-08 14:00:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS BOARD INCREASES DIVIDEND', 'text': "RESTON, VA. , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.32 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE MAY 12, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON APRIL 14, 2023."}